# GitLab CI/CD: Build Docker Image and Push to Docker Hub

## Objective

The objective of this project is to automate the Docker image build and push process using GitLab CI/CD.

Whenever code is pushed to GitLab:

1. GitLab Pipeline starts automatically.
2. Docker image is built.
3. Image is tagged.
4. Image is pushed to Docker Hub.
5. Image can be pulled and run from any environment (KillerCoda, Docker Host, Kubernetes, etc.).

